# --- SMTP ---
# For Gmail SMTP in development use SMTP_SERVICE:
#   SMTP_SERVICE=gmail
#   SMTP_USER=your@gmail.com
#   SMTP_PASS=your-16-char-app-password
#   SMTP_FROM=your@gmail.com   (must match SMTP_USER; Gmail rewrites it)
# When SMTP_SERVICE is set, SMTP_HOST/SMTP_PORT are not required.
# ---
